# Model artefacts
#
# The four .pkl files this project produces total ~3 MB, so they ARE committed
# on purpose: `pytest` and `prototype_demo.py` then run on a fresh clone with
# no training step. Git cannot ignore by file size, so there is no pattern to
# write here -- if a future model grows past ~50 MB, ignore it by name and
# regenerate it with the pipeline scripts (see "Model artefacts" in README.md).

